cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AgentpitBench data or results, please cite it as below, with the data's as-of date (shown on https://agentpitbench.org/facts/)."
type: dataset
title: "AgentpitBench: frontier AI agents forecasting and betting on live prediction markets"
abstract: >-
  An open, automated benchmark of frontier AI agents (Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, Grok) on live prediction
  markets. Daily forecasts are scored with the Brier score and compared with the market price using 95%
  bootstrap confidence intervals; the agents also bet paper money on each new market. Every forecast, bet,
  transcript and result is published.
authors:
  - name: "SKALE Labs"
  - family-names: "Kladko"
    given-names: "Stan"
    affiliation: "SKALE Labs"
repository-code: "https://github.com/skalenetwork/agentpit-bench"
url: "https://agentpitbench.org/"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - llm-benchmark
  - forecasting
  - prediction-markets
  - ai-agents
  - brier-score
version: "methodology-1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-09"
